1
00:00:01,813 --> 00:00:07,191
Vindex: AI grievance triage for Tamil Nadu. Everything runs on one laptop, Gemma 3 on the local GPU, no cloud AI.

2
00:00:07,391 --> 00:00:13,238
A citizen registers once: name, mobile, email and the last 4 Aadhaar digits. They go on every complaint; the AI never sees them.

3
00:00:13,438 --> 00:00:15,863
Preferred language Tamil: every email to this citizen will be in Tamil.

4
00:00:16,063 --> 00:00:20,878
The 6-digit code goes out by email. For this demo the mail server is Mailpit, running on the same laptop.

5
00:00:21,078 --> 00:00:29,238
Mailpit: the OTP mail, in Tamil, the citizen's preferred language.

6
00:00:29,438 --> 00:00:32,519
Enter the code: the account is verified and the citizen is logged in.

7
00:00:32,719 --> 00:00:36,081
My complaints: empty for a new citizen.

8
00:00:36,281 --> 00:00:39,628
The complaint form. 'Filing as' carries the name and Aadhaar digits from the account, never retyped.

9
00:00:39,828 --> 00:00:49,738
Any language, any script. This one is Tanglish: Tamil written in English letters.

10
00:00:49,938 --> 00:00:57,488
In-app camera: a photo, or a video of up to 5 minutes as evidence for the office. Here Chrome's test camera.

11
00:00:57,688 --> 00:01:01,753
A photo upload too. The vision model checks whether the picture matches the text.

12
00:01:01,953 --> 00:01:05,972
GPS from the device, resolved offline to Gandhipuram, Coimbatore. No map API key, no cloud.

13
00:01:06,172 --> 00:01:10,784
Open complaints nearby are listed: a neighbour can support one instead of filing a duplicate.

14
00:01:10,984 --> 00:01:14,331
Tracking ID SYN-2026-000011 in under a second. The analysis starts in the background.

15
00:01:14,531 --> 00:01:39,363
Analysing: Gemma 3 4B on the laptop GPU reads the text and the photo. 12 to 20 seconds, fully local.

16
00:01:39,563 --> 00:01:45,081
Result: Water Supply, Critical, language Tamil-English. Rules forced a human review because children are ill.

17
00:01:45,281 --> 00:01:50,784
Evidence quoted from the original text, the rules that matched, the second-opinion classifier, the office and its due time.

18
00:01:50,984 --> 00:01:56,753
The timeline: every step is a status event. The video and the photo are kept for the office.

19
00:01:56,953 --> 00:02:03,753
Two mails already: the acknowledgement with the tracking ID, then 'under review'. Both in Tamil.

20
00:02:03,953 --> 00:02:07,581
Logging in as the Coimbatore district admin.

21
00:02:07,781 --> 00:02:13,659
The district admin's review queue: critical, low-confidence or disagreeing cases. Nothing closes without a human.

22
00:02:13,859 --> 00:02:24,159
Staff see the masked text with the PII map, the model's reasoning, the second opinion and the evidence.

23
00:02:24,359 --> 00:02:29,113
Accepted: routed to the Coimbatore water office with its SLA. The department admin is emailed.

24
00:02:29,313 --> 00:02:34,488
Logging in as the water department admin.

25
00:02:34,688 --> 00:02:42,097
The water department admin sees only water complaints of Coimbatore, with due times.

26
00:02:42,297 --> 00:02:47,581
Accept starts the work: status In progress.

27
00:02:47,781 --> 00:02:52,503
Request info: the question is emailed to the citizen in Tamil and the case waits for the reply.

28
00:02:52,703 --> 00:02:58,878
Logging in as the second citizen, same street.

29
00:02:59,078 --> 00:03:05,409
Same street, same problem: the nearby list shows Priya's complaint. One tap to support it instead of a duplicate.

30
00:03:05,609 --> 00:03:10,378
Supporters raise the priority: at five, the urgency goes up one level and the queue flags it as popular.

31
00:03:10,578 --> 00:03:14,519
Logging in as the citizen.

32
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:25,722
'The office needs more information': the question is shown on the tracking page.

33
00:03:25,922 --> 00:03:30,691
Reply sent with a photo. It goes straight to the department and the case continues as In progress.

34
00:03:30,891 --> 00:03:36,097
Logging in as the water department admin.

35
00:03:36,297 --> 00:03:46,019
Work done. The admin attaches a resolution photo as proof.

36
00:03:46,219 --> 00:03:50,972
Resolved with a note. The note is translated into Tamil for the citizen's status mail.

37
00:03:51,172 --> 00:03:55,159
Logging in as the citizen.

38
00:03:55,359 --> 00:04:03,659
The citizen sees the proof photo and closes the loop: rate it, or reopen if it is not fixed.

39
00:04:03,859 --> 00:04:08,628
Rated 5 of 5. 'Not fixed, reopen' would send it back to the department with a note.

40
00:04:08,828 --> 00:04:16,972
Logging in as the super admin.

41
00:04:17,172 --> 00:04:22,503
Super admin: every district. Search by tracking ID, name or words from the complaint.

42
00:04:22,703 --> 00:04:31,519
The Overdue badge: a seeded case passed its due time and was escalated to the district admin by email.

43
00:04:31,719 --> 00:04:38,081
District map: markers by urgency, a red ring for overdue, size grows with supporters.

44
00:04:38,281 --> 00:04:50,847
Staff and districts: a district admin for each of the 38 districts, department admins under them, complaints per district.

45
00:04:51,047 --> 00:04:55,409
A new department admin for Chennai roads, created by the super admin.

46
00:04:55,609 --> 00:05:06,175
Created: the password is shown once and a welcome mail goes out. District admins can do the same for their district.

47
00:05:06,375 --> 00:05:15,925
Metrics: accuracy per language, ratings, reopen rate, model latency and live health.

48
00:05:16,125 --> 00:05:23,253
Rules win over the model and are editable without a redeploy. Paste a text to see which rules match.

49
00:05:23,453 --> 00:05:29,800
Matched: gas leak forces Critical and a human review, whatever the model says.

50
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,613
The retrained second-opinion classifier reloads with one click.

51
00:05:36,813 --> 00:05:43,738
The whole interface in Tamil, or Hindi, with one switch.

52
00:05:43,938 --> 00:05:54,378
Every step mailed: the citizen, the department admin and the district admin. Status notes translated into Tamil.

53
00:05:54,578 --> 00:06:00,578
Vindex: 118 automated checks, Tamil, Hindi, English, Tanglish and Hinglish, every decision explained, nothing auto-closed.
